Hub OS P1: adopt a Wayland socket passed with --socket NAME --wayland-fd FD (the wl-restart contract).
Without --wayland-fd driftwm behaves as upstream. Source: docs/proposals/hub-stability.md section 5.9.

diff -ruN a/docs/cli.md b/docs/cli.md
--- a/docs/cli.md
+++ b/docs/cli.md
@@ -21,6 +21,8 @@
