 - `--session-file <PATH>` — Durable session file path. Overrides the default; lets a nested winit dev session opt into session restore (it skips it otherwise)
+- `--socket <NAME>` — Name the Wayland socket (HUB-STABILITY PATCH, wl-restart contract)
+- `--wayland-fd <FD>` — Adopt an already-listening Wayland socket inherited as this fd (HUB-STABILITY PATCH, wl-restart contract: used with --socket)
 - `-V, --version` — Print version
 
